<h2 id="generated">AI, voice and generated output</h2>

AI task, conversation, Assist satellite, speech-to-text, text-to-speech and wake word are separate stages. A wake word is not a transcript. A transcript is not an accepted command. Generated text is not a confirmed device result. Keep the chosen provider, pipeline and the native consent and account limits.

Treat generated output as untrusted content. Label a generated suggestion and its limits, show the device evidence it relies on, and use the native action and permission flow before any work is requested. Never present a model's confident sentence as a safety check or a confirmed household state. If a speech step fails, offer a typed or visual route instead of listening again without explanation. See [Assist, conversation and voice](assist-and-voice.html).

